# throws: FX's Throws page (its fifth) fires them from any track; on the THROW track the keys fire the groups too
wait 200
tap FX
turn SELECT 4
expect page Throws
tap PLAY
wait 500
key 0 down
wait 300
expect punch_drum >0
shot punch_home.png
key 0 up
wait 100
expect punch_drum 0
spin ALGO 9
expect trk 10
tap EDIT
key 1 down
key 14 down
wait 300
shot punch_page.png
key 1 up
key 14 up
spin K1 1
tapkey 3
wait 200
shot punch_latched.png
tapkey 3
# the remembered effect on a step
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
expect note 10 1 1 9
wait 40
shot punch_steps.png
tap PLAY
